Level 3 transfer characteristics at three drain biases
* Provenance: original R3 verification circuit.
Vg gate 0 0
Vd1 d1 0 0.05
M1 d1 gate 0 0 nch w=20u l=5u
Vd2 d2 0 0.5
M2 d2 gate 0 0 nch w=20u l=5u
Vd3 d3 0 2.0
M3 d3 gate 0 0 nch w=20u l=5u
.model nch nmos(level=3 vto=0.55 kp=80u phi=0.65 gamma=0.45 tox=30n theta=0.08)
.save i(Vd1) i(Vd2) i(Vd3)
.dc Vg 0 2.5 0.05
.end
